%% 关键流程时序 · VERSION 3.7.15 · 2026-08-05
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 用户/管理员
  participant N as nginx
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant R as refresh_pipeline
  participant P as profit int分
  participant D as SQLite

  Note over A,R: 日更 ScheduleLoop / 管理端更新数据 = do_full
  A->>R: do_full / generate
  R->>D: build_std + 重放调整
  R->>P: summary_from_conn int 分
  R->>A: publish summary → VM JSON

  Note over U,A: 手填保存 = 增量重算
  U->>N: POST /api/v1/admin/manual*
  N->>A: 
  A->>D: set_manual
  A->>R: recompute rebuild_std=False
  R->>P: summary 重算
  R->>A: publish

  Note over U,A: 调整 = 重建 std + 重放
  U->>A: POST /api/v1/admin/adjust*
  A->>R: recompute rebuild_std=True

  Note over U,A: 导出按需
  U->>A: GET /api/v1/export.html|png|pl.xlsx
  A-->>U: 快照 / PNG / Excel
